{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736240/extras/02ceb5e7555a78c35929f929166a39bd.avif?t=1756430967\" width=800 height=293 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lonely and challenging driving experience. Shift gears, brake at the optimal time, drift, jump, overcome obstacles and, most importantly, drive clean and fast to finish the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the package from the pickup location, deliver it and then escape the growing death zone. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat your previous best time, master each level and vehicle, finish optional objectives to earn money, unlock new jobs and buy new cars with your hard-earned cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Driving</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Delivery Man on Earth features grounded, weighty and challenging driving. Each vehicle behaves in a unique way based on its specifications, such as if it's rear-wheel drive, front-wheel drive or all-wheel drive, its weight, engine, transmission, suspension and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the best car for each job and push it to its limits.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736240/extras/74dce4a79b386efa5dc419638251af6a.poster.avif?t=1756430967\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736240/extras/74dce4a79b386efa5dc419638251af6a.webm?t=1756430967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736240/extras/74dce4a79b386efa5dc419638251af6a.mp4?t=1756430967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earnings and Unlocks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish jobs and optional tasks to unlock new jobs and to earn money. Buy new cars with your earnings. The faster you finish a job, the more you earn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Human population is at the brink of extinction. Communications have been severed and there is a global blackout. There's not a lot of information about what exactly caused this to happen. There was military activity for a few weeks since this happened but now, almost a year later, everything has been eerily quiet.\u00a0  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a freelance delivery man in this recovering world. Your services are now invaluable to the remaining human population, especially since cellular and internet communication is no more. You deliver messages, equipment, food and whatever else the world needs you to deliver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3736240?t=1756430967","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736240/bb187418263885cba92eab299964339b97448ca0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756430967","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736240/12977ac1e262bb2c0cce2ed905c79fd3ab4f8807/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756430967","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736240/12977ac1e262bb2c0cce2ed905c79fd3ab4f8807/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756430967","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736240/extras/02ceb5e7555a78c35929f929166a39bd.avif?t=1756430967\" width=800 height=293 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lonely and challenging driving experience. Shift gears, brake at the optimal time, drift, jump, overcome obstacles and, most importantly, drive clean and fast to finish the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the package from the pickup location, deliver it and then escape the growing death zone. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat your previous best time, master each level and vehicle, finish optional objectives to earn money, unlock new jobs and buy new cars with your hard-earned cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Driving</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Delivery Man on Earth features grounded, weighty and challenging driving. Each vehicle behaves in a unique way based on its specifications, such as if it's rear-wheel drive, front-wheel drive or all-wheel drive, its weight, engine, transmission, suspension and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the best car for each job and push it to its limits.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736240/extras/74dce4a79b386efa5dc419638251af6a.poster.avif?t=1756430967\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736240/extras/74dce4a79b386efa5dc419638251af6a.webm?t=1756430967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736240/extras/74dce4a79b386efa5dc419638251af6a.mp4?t=1756430967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earnings and Unlocks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish jobs and optional tasks to unlock new jobs and to earn money. Buy new cars with your earnings. The faster you finish a job, the more you earn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Human population is at the brink of extinction. Communications have been severed and there is a global blackout. There's not a lot of information about what exactly caused this to happen. There was military activity for a few weeks since this happened but now, almost a year later, everything has been eerily quiet.\u00a0  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a freelance delivery man in this recovering world. Your services are now invaluable to the remaining human population, especially since cellular and internet communication is no more. You deliver messages, equipment, food and whatever else the world needs you to deliver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Rebind"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736240/68f4411ded7fd3eb187082f3701f7d59bb686824/header.jpg?t=1756430967","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257137629,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257137629/movie480.mp4?t=1747195104","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257137629/movie_max.mp4?t=1747195104"},"name":"Main Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257137629/5269e5f6024e73a6bd03db93404878c19f9af5f4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747195104","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257137629/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747195104","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257137629/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747195104"}}],"name":"The Last Delivery Man On Earth","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win